  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"ua07d5b83\" id=\"ua07d5b83\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5ba69069\" id=\"u5ba69069\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">驱动程序可以编译成内核模块，也就是KO文件。每个KO文件是相互独立的，模块之间无法互相访问。但是在某些使用场景下要互相访问，如B模块要用A模块中的函数。（B模块依赖于A模块）这时候我们就需要内核符号表导出</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"VaS8g\" id=\"VaS8g\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4a3b372c\" id=\"u4a3b372c\">内核符号表导出</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ude865c51\" id=\"ude865c51\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u209136bd\" id=\"u209136bd\">内核符号表</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1e478706\" id=\"u1e478706\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufbf58861\" id=\"ufbf58861\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">所谓“符号”就是内核中的函数名，全局变量名等。符号表就是用来记录这些“符号”的文件。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1fc7d840\" id=\"u1fc7d840\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u041802da\" id=\"u041802da\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">内核符号表导出</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud7f43e15\" id=\"ud7f43e15\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf2eb2157\" id=\"uf2eb2157\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">模块可以使用以下宏 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4d3e8987\" id=\"u4d3e8987\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5549f094\" id=\"u5549f094\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">EXPORT_SYMBOL</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0322caed\" id=\"u0322caed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub24fc997\" id=\"ub24fc997\"><span data-lake-id=\"u85526dd0\" id=\"u85526dd0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u31627cf6\" id=\"u31627cf6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> 导出符号到内核符号表中。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc475fd4d\" id=\"uc475fd4d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2d7b5750\" id=\"u2d7b5750\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(17, 24, 39)\">例：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud7f25d1a\" id=\"ud7f25d1a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"><br /></span><code data-lake-id=\"u309fc43e\" id=\"u309fc43e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ecd0201\" id=\"u7ecd0201\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">EXPORT_SYMBOL(符号名);</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue448cb32\" id=\"ue448cb32\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"><br /></span><code data-lake-id=\"ue8968017\" id=\"ue8968017\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07edafc4\" id=\"u07edafc4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-11\" style=\"color: rgb(97, 92, 237); background-color: rgb(239, 238, 255)\">EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(符号名);</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ude2b5a4b\" id=\"ude2b5a4b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\"> // 只适用于包含GPL许可的模块。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u396f556b\" id=\"u396f556b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9efb6922\" id=\"u9efb6922\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 44, 54)\">导出去的符号可以被其他模块使用。使用前只需要声明一下即可。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"wpPgU\" id=\"wpPgU\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u52489434\" id=\"u52489434\">内核模块导出实验</span></h1><blockquote data-lake-id=\"u62e72a1b\" id=\"u62e72a1b\"><p data-lake-id=\"u9cfa8975\" id=\"u9cfa8975\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc2b91cb9\" id=\"uc2b91cb9\">需求:</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u224fd569\" id=\"u224fd569\"><span data-lake-id=\"u75831f46\" id=\"u75831f46\">hello.c依赖mathmodule.c模块</span></p></blockquote><h2 data-lake-id=\"KudTG\" id=\"KudTG\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc9de6abe\" id=\"uc9de6abe\">mathmodule.c</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Clinux%2Finit.h%3E%5Cn%23include%20%3Clinux%2Fmodule.h%3E%5Cnint%20num%20%3D%2010%3B%2F%2F%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0num%5CnEXPORT_SYMBOL(num)%3B%2F%2F%E5%AF%BC%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0num%5Cn%5Cnint%20add(int%20a%2C%20int%20b)%2F%2F%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0add()%EF%BC%8C%E7%94%A8%E6%9D%A5%E5%AE%9E%E7%8E%B0%E5%8A%A0%E6%B3%95%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%20%2B%20b%3B%5Cn%7D%5CnEXPORT_SYMBOL(add)%3B%2F%2F%E5%AF%BC%E5%87%BA%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%A6%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0add()%5Cn%5Cnstatic%20int%20__init%20math_init(void)%2F%2F%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printk(%5C%22math_moudle%20init%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%200%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnstatic%20void%20__exit%20math_exit(void)%2F%2F%E9%A9%B1%E5%8A%A8%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%A3%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20printk(%5C%22math_module%20exit%5C%5Cn%5C%22)%3B%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5Cnmodule_init(math_init)%3B%2F%2F%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnmodule_exit(math_exit)%3B%2F%2F%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%A3%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cn%5CnMODULE_LICENSE(%5C%22GPL%5C%22)%3B%2F%2F%E5%90%8C%E6%84%8FGPL%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%5CnMODULE_AUTHOR(%5C%22topeet%5C%22)%3B%2F%2F%E4%BD%9C%E8%80%85%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%5Cn%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ll7B6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"IpJbp\" id=\"IpJbp\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u697a9031\" id=\"u697a9031\">hello.c</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23inc